  Re-add per-city <url> entries only when real server-side routes
  (/city/{name}) exist — see the SSR item on the HANDOVER roadmap.

  OPERATOR: replace `weekendr.vercel.app` with the final domain
  (also in robots.txt and the canonical/og:url tags in index.html).
-->
